        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Gregor Fisher, Richard Curtis, Sean Scanlan, Rikki Fulton, Andrew Fairlie, Captain Peter \"Para Handy\" MacFarlane, Dougie Cameron, Dan Macphail, Sunny Jim\n- Works: Love Actually, Lassie, Wild Target, The Tales of Para Handy\n- Roles: actor, writer, director, first mate, engineer\n\nFacts:\n- Love Actually is a 2003 Christmas-themed romantic comedy film.\n- Richard Curtis wrote and directed Love Actually.\n- Gregor Fisher had a role in the film Love Actually.\n- Gregor Fisher also had roles in the films Lassie and Wild Target.\n- The Tales of Para Handy starred Gregor Fisher as Captain Peter \"Para Handy\" MacFarlane.\n- The Tales of Para Handy starred Sean Scanlan as first mate Dougie Cameron, Rikki Fulton as engineer Dan Macphail, and Andrew Fairlie as Sunny Jim.",
